-- Every question the keep can ask, with its answer, so the maths can be checked by eye.
--
-- Run it with a seed and read down the list. Anything wrong here is wrong in the game.

please use "parts/questions.polite"

please repeat for every round from 1 to 6:
    show ""
    show "==== floor {round} :: {the name of floor with round} ===================="
    repeat 4 times:
        remember q is a question for with round
        show ""
        show "{item 1 of q or ""}"
        show "  ANSWER: {item 2 of q or ""}"
    thanks
thank you for repeating
